abstract: "A public technical AI trust-enablement and challenge-testing repository for recognition-residue evaluation, hallucination-risk classification, release control, machine-readable certificates, persistent finality records, and fail-closed challenge evaluation. Version 1.2.0 adds a connector-ready Challenge Engine with exploratory, adversarial, and certified modes; explicit natural-language semantic scope; threat-model break classes; challenge-genesis hashing; observer-flow probes; burden/reserve checks; finite-to-limit completion gates; and a final hostile release audit."
